        f"(3 points only ~0.01-0.03 above lambda_c). delta attempted as slope "
        f"of log survival vs log t on L=32 in window [{t1},{t2}] at lambda "
        f"nearest lambda_c, but reported None when no clean power-law decay is "
        f"visible (16-seed resolution). z = overlap collapse of t^theta*rho vs "
        f"t/L^z (theta=DP 0.1595) across sizes 32/64, metric = RMS relative "
        f"spread on the log-overlap support; z_estimate kept None on failure."
    ),
    "evidence": evidence,
    "conclusion": conclusion,
}

